ty markets could determine whether the recovery gains momentum or quickly fades. Link: https://www.fool.com/coverage/stock-market-today/2026/11/22/crypto-market-today-nov-22-bitcoin-reclaims-usd60-000-after-usd1-8-billion-liquidation-wipeout-is-the-worst-over/  ### Can Bitcoin Still Reach $1 Million by 2035? (source: 24/7 Wall St.) Bitcoin has slid more than half from its peak, ETF money is leaving, and the Fed keeps tightening. Yet bulls still cling to a seven-figure dream, and one checkpoint in 2027 could decide whether it survives. Link: https://247wallst.com/investing/cryptocurrency/2026/11/22/can-bitcoin-still-reach-1-million-by-2035/  ### The One Number Behind Every $5 XRP Forecast for 2030 (source: 24/7 Wall St.) Ripple keeps releasing 300 million new tokens every month, and that quietly moves the goalposts for every long-range XRP price target. Two warning signs now test whether the math can ever work, and both are flashing red. Link: https://247wallst.com/investing/cryptocurrency/2026/11/22/the-one-number-behind-every-5-xrp-forecast-for-2030/  ### Russia permits exchange crypto trading from November 22 as digital ruble expands in 2027 (source: IntelliNews) IntelliNews summary: • SPB Exchange has sent its trading and clearing rules to the Bank of Russia; Moscow Exchange plans pilot trades in bitcoin, ether and USDT from December 1. • Non-residents will be able to open digital ruble accounts through Russian banks' apps from November 2027. Link: http://www.intellinews.com/russia-permits-exchange-crypto-trading-from-november-22-as-digital-ruble-expands-in-2027-487363/  ### What Warren Buffett Has Said About Bitcoin and Whether He Was Right (source: 24/7 Wall St.) Warren Buffett has mocked Bitcoin as rat poison and said he wouldn't pay $25 for all of it. Two of his famous jabs come with starting prices, and the scoreboard looks very different depending on which date you pick. Link: https://247wallst.com/investing/cryptocurrency/2026/11/22/what-warren-buffett-has